nodecode-forum-index
=====================

The code in this folder is MIT (see LICENSE).

The directory it carries is a list published on Dread, in the /d/hacking forum,
as the post "Hacking forums and their links"
(b2a0fc81f18dbd6f2068), dated 10 November 2026, and relayed on X by
@solminingpunk (https://x.com/ImVibhek/status/2120370962025599002, a reply to
https://x.com/solminingpunk/status/2120285444180959571). The poster's names,
links, categories, tiers and notes are reproduced as published; the categories
of two entries -- Lolz Forum's "accounts", and the shorthand on a few rows --
are the relay's reading, marked in DATA.LISP by their notes.

No software of any forum's is included, and nothing here is a vouch for any of
them.
